{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54567","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 二十八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 二十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"败军（京本作「占败」）气，鸠尾及鹰（京本作「鹦」）飞。\n或似坏山幷破屋，彼军形（京本作「有」）现败无疑，一战自（京本作「才战便」）奔驰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}